       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. L04.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-CUSTOMER.
           05 WS-CUSTOMER-ID PIC X(6).
           05 WS-CUSTOMER-NAME PIC X(20).
       77 WS-COUNT PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           MOVE "A00001" TO WS-CUSTOMER-ID
           MOVE "Ada Lovelace" TO WS-CUSTOMER-NAME
           DISPLAY WS-CUSTOMER-ID " " WS-CUSTOMER-NAME
           DISPLAY "COUNT=" WS-COUNT
           STOP RUN.
